    "Did you ever use AI to support your math learning in the last year? If yes, how was your experience?": "No, I haven’t used AI directly for math learning—but I’ve admired tools like *Wolfram Alpha* for quick answers when gardening (e.g., calculating fertilizer ratios). My part-time work occasionally involves basic statistical analysis, so if an LLM could simplify formulas or explain concepts in plain terms, it might bridge gaps my low education level faces. Though my introversion means I’d prefer hands-on help over chatbots.",
